= Justice and Policing

Public safety and civil rights both matter. The Department of Justice must remain independent from politics.

- @doj_independence: Protect DOJ independence
- @police_reform: Fund police reform and training
- @community_safety: Invest in community violence prevention
- @easy_discard

@doj_independence
on-arrival: federal_law_loyalty += 0.06; institutions += 2; courts_independence += 1; progressive_dissent += 1; month_actions += 1

Rules insulate prosecutors from political pressure.

@police_reform
subtitle: -1 budget
unavailable-subtitle: Need 1 budget.
choose-if: budget >= 1
on-arrival: budget -= 1; minority_dem += 3*(1-dissent); suburban_dem += 1*(1-dissent); local_police_loyalty += 0.03; directleft_militancy -= 0.03; month_actions += 1

Modest reforms improve accountability while keeping officers on side.

@community_safety
subtitle: -1 budget
unavailable-subtitle: Need 1 budget.
choose-if: budget >= 1
on-arrival: budget -= 1; minority_dem += 2*(1-dissent); suburban_dem += 2*(1-dissent); progressive_dissent -= 2; month_actions += 1

Cities see gradual declines in violent crime.
